+
+### Phase 23: Verified Multi-Year TCO Calculator, Live DOM Mutation Batch Re-Anchoring Observer & Research Session SLA Compliance Auditor
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/pricing-tco-calculator-and-normalizer.cjs`**:
+  - `computeVerifiedMultiYearTcoModel({ pricingClaims, seats, annualDiscountPct })` and `saveVerifiedTcoComparisonViaWorkspace`: normalizes monthly vs annual billing cycles (`"$49/мес"` vs `"$960/год"`), computes 1-month, 12-month, and 36-month TCO across options, strictly rejects bare-link price claims without UTF-16 quotes (`BARE_PRICE_CLAIM_REJECTED`), and saves Markdown/JSON TCO comparison reports via `workspace-service.cjs`.
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/dom-mutation-batch-observer.cjs`**:
+  - `KosworkDomMutationBatchObserver.applyMutationBatchAndReanchor({ tabId, mutations, trackedExcerpts })`: advances `snapshot.pageVersion`, re-anchors existing UTF-16 citations (`reanchored_after_shift`) when prefix DOM insertions shift offsets (`deltaUtf16`), and flags `POST_OBSERVATION_TEXT_SUBSTITUTION_DETECTED` if a quoted span was silently altered after observation.
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/research-session-health-and-sla-auditor.cjs`**:
+  - `auditResearchSessionHealthAndCompliance` and `saveResearchComplianceCertificateViaWorkspace`: verifies explicit search adapter provenance, zero bare-link acceptance, temporal triad (`pageDate`/`eventDate`/`fetchedAt`) separation, Resource Governor live-tab caps (`peakLiveTabs <= maxLiveTabsLimit`), and uncertainty disclosures, producing a SHA-256 Research Session Compliance Certificate (`reports/<slug>.md` and `.json`).
+- **Exposed via `shell.cjs` (`browser.compute_tco_model`, `browser.observe_dom_mutation_batch`, `browser.audit_session_compliance`) and verified in Subtests 38 and 39 (`49/49` total suites passing).**
